{"title":"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Complete)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Complete)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7_(if_you_don&#39;t_know_how_to_divide_polynomials_directly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7 (if you don't know how to divide polynomials directly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Sal_Khan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Sal Khan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the polynomials <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d25c17fbcfc08b828c5a94137ba9462f65f94679.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = x^{6} - x^{5} - x^{3} - x^{2} - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"233\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/2/b323cd59bdfc6632641c166af885474fe0aa2a02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = x^{4} - x^{3} - x^{2} - 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"196\" height=\"19\" /> Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/6/57602174bf07a4375be2cafd2811855b3c258bcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_{1},z_{2},z_{3},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"68\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/e/cfe979d1e34aedc1464f4d59214f8f139863ce1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> are the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00a8b60ad65f43fb7693492b95bb6e8edad13d48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" /> find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/f/3dfbef5771f8ddabf5a3d35f91e5ba870f947a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(z_{1}) + P(z_{2}) + P(z_{3}) + P(z_{4}).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"247\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When we use long division to divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />, the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/7/cc7eb64cedd9e0edafdd33aea8ee4d86afdaa505.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>So, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9ea31e5c5613f025b5be8aca425d318168491d89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> is a root, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e20bef7bb3c48309c8d792d272bd9c80e0621437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(z_1)=(z_1)^2-z_1+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"174\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Now this also follows for all roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />\nNow <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/5/3559dfac01b3d2c6118bd4eabb45b27d7fa1c1b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(z_2)+P(z_1)+P(z_3)+P(z_4)=z_1^2-z_1+1+z_2^2-z_2+1+z_3^2-z_3+1+z_4^2-z_4+1\\]\" width=\"564\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Now by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's</a> we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b382469cba47fd90aa81953284d3ecb0b7afe4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-z_4-z_3-z_2-z_1=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"190\" height=\"14\" />,\nso by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Newton%27s_Sums\" title=\"Newton&#39;s Sums\">Newton's Sums</a> we can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/8/9a88dc9b21c4f3a23220d42d59f278995cf613b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_1^2+z_2^2+z_3^2+z_4^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4411840e163c5ac75c01fc29cea2d3de9d208f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_ns_2+a_{n-1}s_1+2a_{n-2}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"208\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e11625c3ebe91fc9cbca5c8b9bd14a0a7e4a26b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)(s_2)+(-1)(1)+2(-1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"237\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecdc917dde5296b8fdf8a3e5cfb3601e2a687f02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2-1-2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/4/414325d64d17965f907a921e3ca72dda1799e72a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>So finally\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/0/0803d9180cfb89b2e947263789a530d1d8013c86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(z_2)+P(z_1)+P(z_3)+P(z_4)=3+4-1=\\boxed{006}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"409\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Complete.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Complete)\">Solution 2 (Complete)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Complete)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By using long division to divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/8764dd86a31bd6d16646fc0a33780df9c8112633.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = Q(x)(x^2 + 1) + (x^2 - x + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"285\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>For <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polynomial_Remainder_Theorem\" title=\"Polynomial Remainder Theorem\">Polynomial Remainder Theorem</a>,  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/5/3559dfac01b3d2c6118bd4eabb45b27d7fa1c1b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(z_2)+P(z_1)+P(z_3)+P(z_4)=z_1^2-z_1+1+z_2^2-z_2+1+z_3^2-z_3+1+z_4^2-z_4+1\\]\" width=\"564\" height=\"19\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3ab30e2d4bcb549330cd98282a7ed460cd9dc4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow P(z_2)+P(z_1)+P(z_3)+P(z_4)=(z_1^2+z_2^2+z_3^2+z_4^2)-(z_1+z_2+z_3+z_4)+4\\]\" width=\"547\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p>We know that for Vieta's Formula\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/5/0151f77bd866d42ef4919fd3f4185592c972f85c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z_1+z_2+z_3+z_4=\\frac{-b}{a}=\\frac{-(-1)}{1}=1\\]\" width=\"292\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d52a92472c05adc2dcb0f3a54ed27a375ebfc4bf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_1x_2 + x_1x_3 + x_1x_4 + x_2x_3 + x_2x_4 + x_3x_4= \\frac{c}{a} = \\frac{-1}{1} = -1\\]\" width=\"460\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>And, by Newton's Sums\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/e/47e8604acfa2dbff766fa7017157954bf6d69730.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S=(z_1^2+z_2^2+z_3^2+z_4^2)= \\sum_{i=1}^{n=4} z_i^2 = \\left( \\sum_{i=1}^{n=4} z_i \\right)^2 - 2 \\sum_{i=1}^{n=4}z_i z_j \\text{ with } i&lt;j\\]\" width=\"529\" height=\"57\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/6/846d20f9e8fe190a63e68466cea43fcc2443527f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S= \\sum_{i=1}^{n=4} z_i^2 = \\left( \\sum_{i=1}^{n=4} z_i \\right)^2 - 2 \\sum_{i=1}^{n=4}z_i z_j\\]\" width=\"275\" height=\"57\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3bea0096298f2819b04cb2e29fe786fff648ea8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow S = (z_1+z_2+z_3+z_4)-2(x_1x_2 + x_1x_3 + x_1x_4 + x_2x_3 + x_2x_4 + x_3x_4)\\]\" width=\"538\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/3/643b6b4569baeb817be6025afe644723a3818f02.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow S= 1 -2\\times (-1) \\Rightarrow S = 3\\]\" width=\"232\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3ab30e2d4bcb549330cd98282a7ed460cd9dc4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow P(z_2)+P(z_1)+P(z_3)+P(z_4)=(z_1^2+z_2^2+z_3^2+z_4^2)-(z_1+z_2+z_3+z_4)+4\\]\" width=\"547\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/d/e6d383639c69ee3faf2f3c7ce2a3c6d58bb7e3a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow P(z_2)+P(z_1)+P(z_3)+P(z_4) = (3)- 1 + 4 \\therefore \\boxed{ P(z_2)+P(z_1)+P(z_3)+P(z_4)=6}\\]\" width=\"646\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~fmeiramath\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/2/322ec2c1cffe404415734a8795c3ffffbec33bef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_k=z_1^k+z_2^k+z_3^k+z_4^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\" /> then by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formula\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formula\">Vieta's Formula</a> we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/1/cb103dec3c181d269c6d8e3044fee869ab4251a4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_{-1}=\\frac{z_1z_2z_3+z_1z_3z_4+z_1z_2z_4+z_1z_2z_3}{z_1z_2z_3z_4}=0\\]\" width=\"347\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/567d926c8853c85931f2df31a5980637a653b615.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_0=4\\]\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c5ce9e3b8cf360a3152f7572fb5f2654b6d1ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_1=1\\]\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/9/609ac6119b042166569bbda73d0e30c712e54bfa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_2=3\\]\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />\nBy <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Newton%27s_Sums\" title=\"Newton&#39;s Sums\">Newton's Sums</a> we have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/7/067b7dbd2c7a72323cfb1cb6345dd1b3ef95f188.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_4S_k+a_3S_{k-1}+a_2S_{k-2}+a_1S_{k-1}+a_0S_{k-4}=0\\]\" width=\"371\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Applying the formula couples of times yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/6/5e6b55e6e333351333406ddde67f4b6ab3177f89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(z_1)+P(z_2)+P(z_3)+P(z_4)=S_6-S_5-S_3-S_2-S_1=\\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"494\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/0/c8030270ef1fec2ac0025e2810ab59ffce7a1ace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = x^{2}Q(x)+x^{4}-x^{3}-x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"239\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>So we just have to find: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a532ed93bd69cfa09a7752cb973bd20bb12d5a5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=1}^{4} z^{4}_n - \\sum_{n=1}^{4} z^{3}_n - \\sum_{n=1}^{4} z_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"185\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p><p>And by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Newton%27s_Sums\" title=\"Newton&#39;s Sums\">Newton's Sums</a> this computes to: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/b/2dbaf797ba4dbf6152c6be3de4f3aa76f851b692.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11-4-1 = \\boxed{006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"145\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~ LuisFonseca123\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If we scale <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/858095b6a60ebc6dc1aebd6727bedbcd0daf2b38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^6-x^5-x^4-x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" />. In order to get to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />, we add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/1/bb1904bde43f9d49a4e757476a83672e28f57d7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4-x^3-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d40e3c4cc46aac98f62df3c560374066535e9fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=1}^{4} z^4_n-z^3_n-z_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"127\" height=\"55\" />. However, rearranging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d85985ef4b3f5718da0c82c440b7274d012a581.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(z_n) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />, makes our final answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6d1c4bf843c253ccdd108b3c00d2083b7bce893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=1}^{4} z^2_n-z_n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"119\" height=\"55\" />. The sum of the squares of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f863deee7faee9321ad1673d41cb61a62b90be2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^2-2(-1) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"21\" /> and the sum of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Adding 4 to our sum, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31d12ca9300276cb3c580f25ddf7dd2f9f925aa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-1+4 = \\boxed{006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"136\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~ Vedoral\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/8/e880b118bfa7c5db071a4ed8bb0890168702843f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/4/a14e6c3ac028396ced5bcd19d37b0ce866a30b7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z_1^k+z_2^k+z_3^k+z_4^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"138\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Newton%27s_Sums\" title=\"Newton&#39;s Sums\">Newton's Sums</a>,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83fd5d9c438e13755aca0ef98a780346de9d1c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1-1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/c/8ac0bb44a629f74874e93e89c239420acd53cb20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2-S_1-2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/0/1d0b93e2fe4582f80860bfc5799612c2cd6b0d07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_3-S_2-S_1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/0/f80e2ec08fea7c795dba4825df2eef03a1d9976d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_4-S_3-S_2-4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/3/173642bd3176b7c958c7771cf58d62a153eb25be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_5-S_4-S_3-S_1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/6/80641f16a50fe1ea4803765029d33cee86a34380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_6-S_5-S_4-S_2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a22d013f3d9876ee9650945d08544fa0e08da08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1,S_2,S_3,S_4,S_5,S_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b320846f297c6bd9de5bde953e6f3c9ef7081f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1=1, S_2=3, S_3=4, S_4=11, S_5=16, S_6=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"381\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/8/f885317b59e45316bac60f870dfd847de74bc8d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(z_1)+P(z_2)+P(z_3)+P(z_4)=S_6-S_5-S_3-S_2-S_1=\\boxed{006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"514\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_7_.28if_you_don.27t_know_how_to_divide_polynomials_directly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7_(if_you_don't_know_how_to_divide_polynomials_directly)\">Solution 7 (if you don't know how to divide polynomials directly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7 (if you don&#39;t know how to divide polynomials directly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />  look very similar, so let's try subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> multiplied with something from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> since we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d85985ef4b3f5718da0c82c440b7274d012a581.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(z_n) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />. \nTo make the degrees the same, let's first multiply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d56af9a06d7deb6d73d3e588b46275f76974f6bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) \\cdot x^2 = x^6 - x^5 - x^4 - x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"234\" height=\"21\" />. Subtracting this from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93f31a6b55d3e470ec8d9e7a8672a58d9be8529.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 - x^3 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />. The degrees of this polynomial and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> are the same, so let's subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/3/e8367f438902b9c16f9fca56ef96120468bf5174.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 - x^3 - x - Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"21\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/6/5d6dd0343e9067ed3671eb59bf463a170e243660.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4 - x^3 - x - x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + 1 = x^2 - x + 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"355\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/9/67947a1826d60f60ccb4fd52a321d2e0def7347f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) - (x^2 + 1) \\cdot Q(x) = x^2 - x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"284\" height=\"21\" /> (this is also the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />). This tells us that our answer is the sum of the squares of the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> minus the sum of the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> plus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/f/a6f1cd223be419e5e9b50838e3909e5dec71d168.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\cdot 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Newton%27s_Sums\" title=\"Newton&#39;s Sums\">Newton's Sums</a> the sum of the squares of the roots is 3, and by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a> the sum of the roots is 1. So our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/e/eae2b61934132fef3aca3f8a779071123d6a8de8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 - 1  + 4 = \\boxed{006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"136\" height=\"25\" />. \n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:grogg007\">grogg007</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Sal_Khan\">Video Solution by Sal Khan</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Sal Khan\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZSESJ8TeGSI&amp;list=PLSQl0a2vh4HCtW1EiNlfW_YoNAA38D0l4&amp;index=14\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZSESJ8TeGSI&amp;list=PLSQl0a2vh4HCtW1EiNlfW_YoNAA38D0l4&amp;index=14</a>\n- AMBRIGGS\n</p><p><br />\n[rule]\n</p><p>Nice!-sleepypuppy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II\" title=\"2003 AIME II\">2003 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2003\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017001133\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 535/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1808/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 130/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 16563/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.185      1 -total\n 58.09%    7.078      1 Template:AIME_box\n 40.14%    4.891      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3105:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017001133 and revision id 275559. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}